00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:22,239
Still got a toothache?

846
00:34:23,840 --> 00:34:26,639
The dentist said there's an infection inside.

847
00:34:26,639 --> 00:34:27,840
They need to open it up first,

848
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:29,440
treat it, and then seal it back.

849
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:31,519
It has to be done sooner or later.

850
00:34:31,519 --> 00:34:32,440
If you don't treat it now,

851
00:34:32,440 --> 00:34:33,800
it'll rot away later.

852
00:34:34,239 --> 00:34:35,840
Just like Cao Liaoping.

853
00:34:35,840 --> 00:34:36,840
How do you want to handle him?

854
00:34:37,639 --> 00:34:40,760
Intelligence relationships are like dating.

855
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:42,800
You get closer, they pull away.

856
00:34:43,320 --> 00:34:44,960
You can't rush it.

857
00:34:47,519 --> 00:34:49,280
If they're not willing,

858
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:51,519
what can I do?

859
00:35:43,679 --> 00:35:44,559
Over the years,

860
00:35:44,559 --> 00:35:47,159
we've sent a group of young agents to infiltrate the mainland.

861
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:48,480
But how do you know

862
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:50,239
how many of them haven't been compromised by the other side,

863
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:52,719
and sent back to infiltrate our own ranks?

864
00:35:53,719 --> 00:35:54,559
We have people in their ranks,

865
00:35:54,559 --> 00:35:55,719
and they have people in ours.

866
00:35:56,119 --> 00:35:58,559
That's the nature of intelligence work.

867
00:35:59,119 --> 00:36:00,360
The mainland has also planted

868
00:36:00,639 --> 00:36:02,760
and developed many agents in Taiwan, China.

869
00:36:03,320 --> 00:36:05,880
Don't think they aren't watching you.

870
00:36:35,039 --> 00:36:36,119
First floor, thanks.

871
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:46,280
Young man.

872
00:36:47,920 --> 00:36:48,960
Where are you from?

873
00:36:50,239 --> 00:36:51,280
I'm from out of town.

874
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:52,800
I just got here not long ago.

875
00:36:53,639 --> 00:36:54,440
Taiwan, China.

876
00:36:57,119 --> 00:36:59,000
Am I right?

877
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:01,440
People from around here...

878
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:03,400
...can tell at a glance.

879
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:06,639
You here for business?

880
00:37:07,400 --> 00:37:08,320
Just a small business.

881
00:37:13,360 --> 00:37:14,360
Take care.

882
00:37:17,199 --> 00:37:18,440
For members of the photography association,

883
00:37:18,440 --> 00:37:20,960
eight out of ten provided portrait photos

884
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:23,239
as well as their past portfolios.

885
00:37:23,599 --> 00:37:25,199
Chief Wei taught us...

886
00:37:25,280 --> 00:37:26,639
...smart people do the grunt work.

887
00:37:26,639 --> 00:37:27,400
The most important thing...

888
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:29,639
...is finding a needle in a haystack.

889
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:30,639
You search step by step.

890
00:37:30,719 --> 00:37:31,559
First in the ocean...

891
00:37:31,559 --> 00:37:32,199
...then the river...

892
00:37:32,400 --> 00:37:34,119
...then the basin, and finally the bowl.

893
00:37:34,119 --> 00:37:35,320
That's the only way to search.

894
00:37:35,360 --> 00:37:36,800
Find this photo,

895
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:37,760
or any places related

896
00:37:37,760 --> 00:37:38,880
to this photo.

897
00:37:38,880 --> 00:37:41,280
People, trees, alleys...

898
00:37:41,480 --> 00:37:42,400
...anything works.

899
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:45,360
Still half a minute left.

900
00:37:45,719 --> 00:37:46,519
So I'm not late.

901
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:48,320
Went to Wedding Photo Studio Street again this morning.

902
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,280
You're the most experienced here.

903
00:37:50,280 --> 00:37:51,840
Tell me if these two newlyweds...

904
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:53,760
...have the potential to be a dual-police family.

905
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:55,880
What's so good about a dual-police family?

906
00:37:56,119 --> 00:37:57,480
Neither of you is ever home.

907
00:37:59,360 --> 00:38:01,360
Rushing to take wedding photos early in the morning.

908
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:03,280
Won't people suspect a shotgun wedding?

909
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,679
We're a working couple in a hurry...

910
00:38:04,800 --> 00:38:06,880
...trying to catch the first light of dawn.

911
00:38:07,480 --> 00:38:08,800
Rather than investigating passively...

912
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:09,880
...it's better to take the initiative.

913
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,679
I requested an outdoor wedding shoot.

914
00:38:11,679 --> 00:38:12,920
I wanted dynamic shots, not static ones.

915
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:13,800
We had all photo studios

916
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:15,199
gather the photos their photographers took,

917
00:38:15,199 --> 00:38:17,360
specifically of local alleys and streets,

918
00:38:17,360 --> 00:38:18,599
and bring out all those photos.

919
00:38:18,599 --> 00:38:19,199
We screened them one by one,

920
00:38:19,199 --> 00:38:20,280
then nitpicked,

921
00:38:20,599 --> 00:38:23,199
to find capable, veteran photographers with steady hands

922
00:38:23,199 --> 00:38:24,800
and rich experience in tracking shots.

923
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:25,800
Through this rigorous process,

924
00:38:26,039 --> 00:38:27,559
we filtered out four left-handers.

925
00:38:28,719 --> 00:38:30,280
We eliminated one female photographer.

926
00:38:30,280 --> 00:38:31,280
That leaves three.

927
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:33,320
One is a retired newspaper reporter.

928
00:38:33,320 --> 00:38:34,280
One is a postman

929
00:38:34,280 --> 00:38:35,920
who freelances for the newspaper.

930
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:37,920
And the last is the president of the photography association.

931
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:39,320
This president is named Qian Xinfu.

932
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,519
He works at the Price Bureau.

933
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:43,639
Ma Qi, it matches your findings.

934
00:38:43,800 --> 00:38:45,760
Can we confirm if Section Chief Qian...

935
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:46,960
...is a left-hander?

936
00:38:48,880 --> 00:38:50,199
His father was a sports school coach.

937
00:38:50,199 --> 00:38:51,880
Taught him table tennis from a young age.

938
00:38:51,880 --> 00:38:53,000
He trained to be ambidextrous.

939
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:54,400
He uses chopsticks with his left hand...

940
00:38:54,400 --> 00:38:55,360
...and writes with his right.

941
00:38:55,360 --> 00:38:57,280
He switches hands when holding a wine glass.

942
00:38:57,280 --> 00:38:58,239
He's just divided like that.

943
00:38:58,880 --> 00:39:00,599
A fox only has so many tails.

944
00:39:00,719 --> 00:39:02,719
Let's check the files before we find the person.

945
00:39:02,719 --> 00:39:03,840
You three young people...

946
00:39:03,840 --> 00:39:04,880
...grab some chairs and help us look.

947
00:39:04,880 --> 00:39:05,440
Okay.

948
00:39:10,159 --> 00:39:12,599
This is the Municipal Census Office.

949
00:39:13,599 --> 00:39:14,280
We're doing a background registration.

950
00:39:14,280 --> 00:39:15,280
Just checking on some things.

951
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:18,039
We'd like to understand...

952
00:39:18,039 --> 00:39:20,840
...the basic situation of frontline active staff.

953
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:22,280
How about this...

954
00:39:22,280 --> 00:39:24,719
...you can just go by their length of service.

955
00:39:25,119 --> 00:39:27,400
Briefly explain the basic situation of the post office.

956
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:30,760
Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up.

957
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:46,480
You just said you singled out a

958
00:39:46,559 --> 00:39:48,239
postman who writes part-time for the paper.

959
00:39:48,239 --> 00:39:49,119
Do you have a photo?

960
00:39:50,719 --> 00:39:51,559
This is the guy.

961
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:55,320
No. 2, Lane 75.

962
00:39:55,360 --> 00:39:56,280
I've been here three times.

963
00:39:56,280 --> 00:39:57,480
No one's home.

964
00:40:03,199 --> 00:40:03,960
Say something.

965
00:40:04,519 --> 00:40:05,559
I've seen him before.

966
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:06,840
He's delivered packages to me.

967
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:07,880
He's the left-hander.

968
00:40:10,760 --> 00:40:11,559
Found him.

969
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:12,840
Three years ago, the retired reporter

970
00:40:12,840 --> 00:40:14,039
already emigrated overseas.

971
00:40:14,039 --> 00:40:15,159
He just passed away recently.

972
00:40:15,159 --> 00:40:16,719
Now we only have two suspects left.

973
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:17,400
Good.

974
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:19,400
Team One, Qian Xinfu.

975
00:40:19,639 --> 00:40:20,679
Team Two, the postman.

976
00:40:20,880 --> 00:40:21,199
Move out.

977
00:40:23,239 --> 00:40:23,840
Who are you looking for?

978
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:24,760
I'm looking for Wang Xiaoqiang.

979
00:40:25,559 --> 00:40:26,199
Sign in here.

980
00:40:29,440 --> 00:40:31,280
Fill in the unit number, your name,

981
00:40:32,119 --> 00:40:33,840
and your work phone number.

982
00:40:36,599 --> 00:40:37,639
Where is the restroom?

983
00:40:37,760 --> 00:40:38,639
Up ahead. Up ahead.

984
00:40:39,199 --> 00:40:40,079
Not from around here, huh?

985
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:43,480
Do I sound like a local to you?

986
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:44,599
Can't understand me, huh?

987
00:40:45,639 --> 00:40:46,360
Where are you from?

988
00:40:46,440 --> 00:40:46,960
Henan.

989
00:40:47,719 --> 00:40:48,679
The restroom is just up ahead.

990
00:40:49,079 --> 00:40:49,440
Okay.

991
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:50,119
Thanks a lot.

992
00:40:50,320 --> 00:40:50,880
Sure.

993
00:41:05,760 --> 00:41:06,239
Keep up.

994
00:41:35,599 --> 00:41:36,480
Three

995
00:41:36,639 --> 00:41:37,480
Two

996
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:38,840
One

997
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:40,320
Alright.

998
00:41:41,880 --> 00:41:42,400
Boss,

999
00:41:42,400 --> 00:41:43,440
should we take

1000
00:41:43,440 --> 00:41:44,280
a couple more shots?

1001
00:41:44,280 --> 00:41:45,039
Just to have some backups?

1002
00:41:45,239 --> 00:41:46,239
No need, there's no time.

1003
00:41:46,840 --> 00:41:47,800
I'll pack up then.

1004
00:41:47,920 --> 00:41:48,280
Okay.

1005
00:41:56,400 --> 00:41:57,719
The place he went into

1006
00:41:57,719 --> 00:41:59,079
is Deputy Mayor Xie's residence.

1007
00:41:59,079 --> 00:42:00,280
He clearly knows his way around.

1008
00:42:00,679 --> 00:42:01,800
How do we handle this?

1009
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:04,639
Should we give the Director a heads-up

1010
00:42:04,639 --> 00:42:05,440
and ask for instructions?

1011
00:42:06,840 --> 00:42:08,039
The Director is so busy.

1012
00:42:08,480 --> 00:42:09,960
Aren't you just causing trouble for him?

1013
00:42:12,119 --> 00:42:13,599
We caught a rabbit while gathering grass.

1014
00:42:14,599 --> 00:42:15,960
But the rabbit won't care

1015
00:42:15,960 --> 00:42:17,360
about what happens to the grass.

1016
00:42:17,880 --> 00:42:19,559
The rabbit will only get angry.

1017
00:42:20,199 --> 00:42:21,760
That's why you'll never be the rabbit.

1018
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:24,159
Your political awareness is knee-high.

1019
00:42:24,519 --> 00:42:25,960
You'll struggle to even make Section Chief.

1020
00:42:25,960 --> 00:42:27,000
If I monitor a city official,

1021
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:28,440
I'll barely survive as a Group Leader.

1022
00:42:33,159 --> 00:42:34,880
We are not monitoring a city official.

1023
00:42:35,159 --> 00:42:36,559
We are keeping an eye on and protecting

1024
00:42:36,559 --> 00:42:38,079
the President of the Photography Association.

1025
00:42:41,400 --> 00:42:42,880
You're a good rabbit.

1026
00:43:08,440 --> 00:43:09,159
I'm Wang Kai,

1027
00:43:09,519 --> 00:43:10,880
inviting you to watch the drama

1028
00:43:11,159 --> 00:43:11,880
Crossfire.

1029
00:43:12,480 --> 00:43:12,920
Stop the car!

1030
00:43:12,920 --> 00:43:13,480
Stop the car!

1031
00:43:13,679 --> 00:43:14,360
Watch out!

1032
00:43:15,760 --> 00:43:17,079
We're from the Minzhong City National Security Bureau.

1033
00:43:17,079 --> 00:43:18,400
We want to ask Fan Chen a few questions.

1034
00:43:24,199 --> 00:43:25,239
Why didn't you go after him when he ran?

1035
00:43:25,400 --> 00:43:26,280
I didn't react in time.

1036
00:43:26,480 --> 00:43:27,360
If I were in charge,

1037
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:28,440
I'd suspect you.

1038
00:43:28,679 --> 00:43:31,159
I think there's something suspicious about He Chunxiao.

1039
00:43:31,480 --> 00:43:32,079
Under no circumstances

1040
00:43:32,079 --> 00:43:33,000
should you baselessly suspect

1041
00:43:33,000 --> 00:43:34,519
your own comrades in arms,

1042
00:43:34,639 --> 00:43:35,239
unless

1043
00:43:35,599 --> 00:43:37,119
you can provide ironclad evidence.
